This repository accompanies the study "Comparative Feasibility Evaluation of
Marker-Based and Markerless Computer-Vision Pose Estimation for Quantitative
Human Motion Analysis: An Initial Methods Comparison." The data and code are
published so that the results of that study can be inspected and verified.

